  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_01",
      "hash64": "23B358EDDFA19B4F",
      "text": "嘿！吃了吗？\\n欢迎来到玻瓶道馆！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_02",
      "hash64": "23B359EDDFA19D02",
      "text": "吁、吁～！？\\n怎么？原来是你啊！\\r\\n俺把你当成了另一个客人！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "8C63E93F1A5A5906",
      "text": "首席冠军？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "8C63E83F1A5A5753",
      "text": "我是替她来的",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_03",
      "hash64": "23B35AEDDFA19EB5",
      "text": "哦！这样啊，这样啊！\\n是也慈小姐安排的啊！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_04",
      "hash64": "23B353EDDFA192D0",
      "text": "你前不久还在收集徽章，\\n现在居然都成了冠军级啊～！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_05",
      "hash64": "23B354EDDFA19483",
      "text": "简直就像跳龙门的鱼宝可梦！\\n活蹦乱跳地完成进化，爆护啊！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_06",
      "hash64": "23B355EDDFA19636",
      "text": "想不到你这个最有出息的\\n会亲自来鉴定俺的本事啊～！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_07",
      "hash64": "23B356EDDFA197E9",
      "text": "不过俺经营餐厅没少被评估，\\n对这种事已经驾轻就熟咯。[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_08",
      "hash64": "23B35FEDDFA1A734",
      "text": "好啦，要验证俺够不够格当道馆馆主，\\n就和俺来场对战吧！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_retry",
      "hash64": "40E90C6A0916AEC6",
      "text": "嘿！吃了吗？怎么样？\\n要和俺来场对战吗？[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_09",
      "hash64": "23B360EDDFA1A8E7",
      "text": "好咧！\\n跟叔叔来！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_10",
      "hash64": "23B65DEDDFA3D9A5",
      "text": "食材和对决最重要的就是要在旺季！\\n你要保持完好无损，赶快回来啊！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
